{"2261380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Croakwood", "steam_appid": 2261380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the lush and mysterious Croakwood Forest, a tiny community of frogs is ready to put down roots and make the wild woods their home. Build a thriving woodland settlement as your froggy villagers gather resources, craft supplies, and hop between homes, workshops, and winding forest paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design cozy cottages and charming frog neighborhoods with a flexible piece-based building system, uncover secrets hidden beneath the canopy, and expand deeper into the forest as your community grows. Croakwood blends creative town building, relaxed management, and cozy exploration into a laid-back woodland adventure full of charm, nature, and lively little amphibians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create a Town Worth Croaking About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the wild woods into a thriving frog settlement with a flexible piece-based building system full of customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.poster.avif?t=1781852906\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.webm?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.mp4?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Your Frog Locals Leap to Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croakwood’s tiny amphibian townsfolk each play a role in your growing settlement. Watch frogs gather resources, craft supplies, explore the town, and go about their daily routines as your cozy woodland community springs to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/418b0dd56991fae3c29548eb4805d3b1.poster.avif?t=1781852906\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/418b0dd56991fae3c29548eb4805d3b1.webm?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/418b0dd56991fae3c29548eb4805d3b1.mp4?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Forest Full of Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond your town lies a lush ancient forest filled with hidden secrets, new areas to discover, and opportunities for your settlement to grow. Explore the wilderness, unlock new areas, and guide your frog community deeper into the Croakwood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/d18c6ab27009442e8c45e7f8eb2d18a9.poster.avif?t=1781852906\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/d18c6ab27009442e8c45e7f8eb2d18a9.webm?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/d18c6ab27009442e8c45e7f8eb2d18a9.mp4?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/ae6d244e01892bf8f40f2470711ed5b4.poster.avif?t=1781852906\" width=610 height=46 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/ae6d244e01892bf8f40f2470711ed5b4.webm?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the lush and mysterious Croakwood Forest, a tiny community of frogs is ready to put down roots and make the wild woods their home. Build a thriving woodland settlement as your froggy villagers gather resources, craft supplies, and hop between homes, workshops, and winding forest paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design cozy cottages and charming frog neighborhoods with a flexible piece-based building system, uncover secrets hidden beneath the canopy, and expand deeper into the forest as your community grows. Croakwood blends creative town building, relaxed management, and cozy exploration into a laid-back woodland adventure full of charm, nature, and lively little amphibians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create a Town Worth Croaking About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the wild woods into a thriving frog settlement with a flexible piece-based building system full of customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.poster.avif?t=1781852906\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.webm?t=1781852906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261380/extras/6845c7ce867f51eb61df44d8a25e3e9e.mp4?t=1781852906\" type=\"vi